       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Total daily dose:** 3000 mg three times daily is 9,000 mg/day. The usual adult maximum is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day. At 9,000 mg/day, the risk of acute hepatotoxicity and liver failure is high, even with normal liver function.\n- **Single dose:** 3000 mg is three times the usual maximum single dose of 1,000 mg.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1000 mg orally three times daily** (3,000 mg/day total)\n- **650 mg orally every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day total)\n- **1000 mg orally every 6\u20138 hours**, with a maximum of 3\u20134 g/day\n\nIf you do want 3000 mg three times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I'd want to be sure it's intentional before I enter it. Once you tell me the dose and frequency, I'll enter it right away."
